Let words be a list of "flower", "flow", and "flight".
Let reference be item 0 of words.
Let limit be the number of characters in reference.
For each word in words.
Let size be the number of characters in word.
If size is less than limit, set limit to size.

Let count be the number of items in words.
Let prefix be empty text.
Let last be limit minus 1.
For every position from 0 to last.
Let matches be 0.
For each word in words, if character position of word is character position of reference, add 1 to matches.
If matches is count, append character position of reference to prefix, otherwise stop.

Print prefix.
